  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Development: Smallholder Agricultural Competitiveness Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project goal is to contribute to smallholders&#xbf; responsiveness and competitiveness in high value crop (HVC) production and marketing of fresh and/or processed products. The project development objective is to improve farmers&#xbf; incomes and livelihoods through demand-led productivity investments, crop diversification and increased market linkages</narrative>
  </description>
